{
  "bodyHash": "51489dc3b460a773",
  "content": "\n\n<h1>LDLib2</h1>\n<p><strong>一款現代化的 Minecraft 模組開發函式庫，專為使用者介面、渲染、資料同步、持久化儲存與遊戲內編輯器設計。</strong></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://github.com/Low-Drag-MC/LDLib2/stargazers\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/github/stars/low-drag-mc/ldlib2?style=for-the-badge&logo=github\" alt=\"GitHub 星標\"></a>\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ldlib\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/curseforge/dt/626676?style=for-the-badge&logo=curseforge&label=CurseForge\" alt=\"CurseForge 下載數\"></a>\n<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fldlib\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/modrinth/dt/ldlib?style=for-the-badge&logo=modrinth&label=Modrinth\" alt=\"Modrinth 下載數\"></a>\n<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmaven.firstdark.dev%252fsnapshots%252fcom%252flowdragmc%252fldlib2%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/maven-metadata/v?style=for-the-badge&label=latest&metadataUrl=https://maven.firstdark.dev/snapshots/com/lowdragmc/ldlib2/ldlib2-neoforge-1.21.1/maven-metadata.xml\" alt=\"最新 Maven 版本\"></a>\n<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fneoforged.net%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/NeoForge-21.1 -E04E14?style=for-the-badge\" alt=\"NeoForge\"></a>\n<a href=\"LICENSE\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/github/license/low-drag-mc/ldlib2?style=for-the-badge\" alt=\"授權資訊\"></a></p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252flow-drag-mc.github.io%252fLowDragMC-Doc%252fen%252fldlib2%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">文件說明</a> | <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252flow-drag-mc.github.io%252fLowDragMC-Doc%252fen%252fldlib2%252fjava_integration.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Java 整合</a> | <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252flow-drag-mc.github.io%252fLowDragMC-Doc%252fen%252fldlib2%252fui%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">UI 指南</a> | <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdiscord.com%252finvite%252fsDdf2yD9bh\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Discord</a> | <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ldlib\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">CurseForge</a> | <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fldlib\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Modrinth</a></p>\n<hr>\n<p>LDLib2 是原始 <a href=\"https://github.com/Low-Drag-MC/LDLib-MultiLoader\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">LDLib</a> 的完全重寫版本，針對現代 Minecraft 與 NeoForge 開發流程重新設計。它為模組作者提供了一個更高階的基礎架構，讓您在建立 UI、遊戲內工具、渲染支援內容、同步資料與持久化執行階段系統時，無需於每個專案中重複建構相同的基礎設施。</p>\n<h2>功能亮點</h2>\n<table>\n<tr>\n<td>\n\n<span><span><iframe width=\"560\" height=\"315\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/Ic5H3YoVPjQ?si=Qu6U8hDdl9L2kTcX\" frameborder=\"0\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span><br>\n<strong><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252flow-drag-mc.github.io%252fLowDragMC-Doc%252fen%252fldlib2%252fui%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\">LDLib2 UI</a></strong><br>\n使用 Taffy 驅動版面配置、LSS 樣式表、可重複使用的元件、XML 定義、資料繫結、RPC 事件與 HUD 覆蓋層，輕鬆打造 Minecraft 遊戲畫面。\n</td>\n<td>\n<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252flow-drag-mc.github.io%252fLowDragMC-Doc%252fen%252fldlib2%252fsync%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Low-Drag-MC/LDLib2/refs/heads/1.21/.github/readme/sync-persistence.svg\" alt=\"資料同步與持久化概覽\"></a><br>\n<strong><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252flow-drag-mc.github.io%252fLowDragMC-Doc%252fen%252fldlib2%252fsync%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\">資料同步與持久化</a></strong><br>\n為欄位加上 <code>@Persisted</code>、<code>@DescSynced</code> 註解，並搭配 RPC 輔助工具，即可自動生成 NBT IO、編解碼器（codecs）、髒欄位同步與封包傳輸流程，大幅減少样板程式碼。\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>\n<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252flow-drag-mc.github.io%252fLowDragMC-Doc%252fen%252fldlib2%252fnode-graph-toolkit%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Low-Drag-MC/LowDragMC-Doc/v2/docs/en/ldlib2/node-graph-toolkit/assets/ngt-overview-placeholder.png\" alt=\"節點圖表工具箱編輯器\"></a><br>\n<strong><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252flow-drag-mc.github.io%252fLowDragMC-Doc%252fen%252fldlib2%252fnode-graph-toolkit%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\">節點圖表工具箱</a></strong><br>\n建立包含節點、連接埠、線路、變數、子圖表、黑板（blackboard）、可復原指令以及資源支援圖表資產的遊戲內圖表編輯器。\n</td>\n<td>\n<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252flow-drag-mc.github.io%252fLowDragMC-Doc%252fen%252fldlib2%252feditor%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Low-Drag-MC/LowDragMC-Doc/v2/docs/en/ldlib2/editor/assets/ui_editor.png\" alt=\"LDLib2 遊戲內 UI 編輯器\"></a><br>\n<strong><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252flow-drag-mc.github.io%252fLowDragMC-Doc%252fen%252fldlib2%252feditor%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\">遊戲內編輯器框架</a></strong><br>\n打造類似 Unity、Blender 或 Blockbench 風格的工具，具備可停靠視窗、專案檔案、資源瀏覽器、檢查器（inspector）、歷史紀錄、設定選項與自訂編輯面板。\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>\n<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252flow-drag-mc.github.io%252fLowDragMC-Doc%252fen%252fldlib2%252fconfigurable%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Low-Drag-MC/LowDragMC-Doc/v2/docs/en/ldlib2/configurable/assets/configurator_example.png\" alt=\"自動生成的 Configurable 屬性編輯器\"></a><br>\n<strong><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252flow-drag-mc.github.io%252fLowDragMC-Doc%252fen%252fldlib2%252fconfigurable%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\">Configurable</a></strong><br>\n將標註過的 Java 物件轉換為檢查器可用的屬性面板，支援範圍控制、選取器、列表、資源位置、搜尋欄位、復原歷史紀錄與持久化儲存。\n</td>\n<td>\n<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252flow-drag-mc.github.io%252fLowDragMC-Doc%252fen%252fldlib2%252fui%252fxei_support.html\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://github.com/Low-Drag-MC/LDLib2/blob/1.21/.github/readme/xei.png?raw=true\" alt=\"LDLib2 XEI 整合\"></a><br>\n<strong><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252flow-drag-mc.github.io%252fLowDragMC-Doc%252fen%252fldlib2%252fui%252fxei_support.html\" rel=\"nofollow\">渲染與整合支援</a></strong><br>\n結合 LDLib2 的着色器、紋理、模型渲染、場景與編輯器工具，並無縫整合常見的模組開發工作流程，例如 JEI、REI、EMI、KubeJS 及 Java 插件進入點。\n</td>\n</tr>\n</table>\n<p>如需完整操作說明，請參考 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252flow-drag-mc.github.io%252fLowDragMC-Doc%252fen%252fldlib2%252fui%252fgetting_start.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">UI 入門指南</a>。</p>\n<h2>相關連結</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252flow-drag-mc.github.io%252fLowDragMC-Doc%252fen%252fldlib2%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">文件說明</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/Low-Drag-MC/LDLib2\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">GitHub 原始碼倉庫</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ldlib\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">CurseForge 專案頁面</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fldlib\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Modrinth 專案頁面</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdiscord.com%252finvite%252fsDdf2yD9bh\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Discord 社群</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/Low-Drag-MC/LDLib-MultiLoader\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">原始 LDLib</a></li>\n</ul>\n<h2>授權條款</h2>\n<p>LDLib2 採用 <a href=\"LICENSE\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">LGPL-3.0 授權條款</a>。</p>",
